@startuml sequence_diagram_get
skinparam handwritten true
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rect
skinparam defaultFontName FG Virgil
skinparam shadowing false

actor User as Actor
participant "U I" as UI <<presentation>>
participant BackEnd as BackEnd <<C4 Container>>
database Database

title Read Xpto

Actor --> UI: Read Xpto
activate UI

    UI --> BackEnd: HTTP GET /api/xpto/{id}

    activate BackEnd

        BackEnd --> Database: SELECT (where id = id)
        activate Database
            Database --> BackEnd: xptoInstance?
        deactivate Database

        BackEnd --> UI: HTTP Response
    deactivate BackEnd

UI --> Actor: Show Xpto details
deactivate UI
            
@enduml